{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/archive/component/aspace_d47bc46ae735b933dd36075509cb2f3a","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"aspace_d47bc46ae735b933dd36075509cb2f3a","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Dorothy Stewart to and from Delia Lewis","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"abstract","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/abstract"}],"content":"Correspondence from Dorothy Stewart to Delia Lewis: There are eight dated letters and two dated postcards from Stewart to Lewis in this archive and this binder, Jan. 3 or 4, 1928 - August 9, 1938. There is one letter from Santa Fe; four from various locales in Mexico; two letters and two postcards from various locales in France; and one letter from Athens, Greece. The letter of Dec. 20, 1930 is illustrated, as are the letter of Oct. 2, 1937 [especially decorative], and the postcard of Aug. 9, 1938. The letter of Aug. 6, 1935 discusses M.C.'s eye operation in Mexico and the postcards and letters of 1937 and 1938 concern Stewart's travels in Europe with M.C. There are eight undated letters written from Stewart to Lewis. Four are written from Santa Fe; two from Mexico, D.F.; one from Hastings, NB; and one from Glacier National Park, which is illustrated with drawings of Blackfoot Indians. Correspondence from Delia Stewart Lewis to Dorothy Stewart: There is one post card, Aug. 16, 1954, from Lewis to Stewart from Greece.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"EAD Related Material","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/relatedmaterial"}],"content":[],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"EAD Legal status statement","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/userestrict"}],"content":null,"type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"Set"}